{
  "id": "2TI.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "2TI",
  "reference": "2 Timoteo 2",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2TI 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nshilikale wa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū bebe ng'wana wane handatīlaga kūlwa shigongo īsho shilī mulī Kilisito Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo īyo waniigwaga nakwīhayaga kū būtongi bo banhū bingī, binhage banhū basanyiwa, abo nabo badūgije kūbalanga bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyūmīlījage ūbize mo nang'ho ū mu būluhi, gīt'ūmo īng'wigeleelilwe nshilikale wawiza wa ng'wa Kilisito Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atīho nshilikale ūyo atogilwe kūnyeja ūyo wantūūla mu nīmo, alīyo ū kūnū wisangīlīja na mu milīmo yīngī hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ū munhū ūlū wingīla mu wigusha kūlwa kwitinda na biye, atūpandīka ī mheela ūlū atigushije kūlondeela ūmo shilī ī shilagīlo sha wigusha wenūbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nīmi ūyo akūkoya koyaga na nīmo, shiigelile apandīke matwajo ga kwandya ū mu nīmo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwiganikage chiza ūyo nalīgūhaya, nguno ū Seeba akūkwinha witegeleja mu yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wizūkagwe ū Yesu Kilisito, ū wa lūganda lo ng'wa Daūdi, ūyo akajūūka kūfuma mu bafu; gīt'ūmo jihayīlile ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza jane, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ījo jikūnenhelejaga kūluha mu būtungwa gītī nalī nkenaagūji. Alīyo nahene ū mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu gūtīko ū kūtungwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene nakwiyūmīlījaga mu mihayo yose kūlwa basolwa, gīkī nabo ū mulī Kilisito Yesu banukūle ikūjo lya shiku jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gūtūngīlīgije,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ntūmami nsanyiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbizūkīja gwa ī mihayo yenīyī, hama ūbahūgūla mu welwa ng'holò kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu, gīkī yaya ū kwihalalīja kūlwa nguno ya mihayo īyo ītī na fiilū. Ū gwenūyū gūtī na solobo ū kū badegeleki, ūlū ītī kūbasambagūla dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ng'wene komeelaga, wiyooleche gīkī ūlī ntūmami azunyiwe na Mulungu, ūyo atī na nguno ya kūding'wa minala; ūgūgoloola chiza ū mhayo gwa ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī mihayo ī midūhū na ya nyachilū chilū, yihūngage; nguno īkongejaga kūbingīja mu būbi abo bakīkūūbīlījaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū mhayo gwabo gūkongeja kūlandaala, gūbize gītī ilonda līmholela kūlimu; ū mu banhū ba mbika yenīyo balīmo na a ba Humaneyo nū Fileto! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo bījimīīgije ī ng'hana, bandije kūja bakūkenaagūlaga kūzunya kwa banhū bamò; bakūhayaga gīkī ū būjūūko bomala kūshika! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nahene ū nsingi go ng'wa Mulungu gūtaalī ū kūgalūka ūmo gwīmīīlīlile, ū lūmeng'ho lwago lūhayile gīkī, “Ū Seeba abamanile a bakwe,” na gīkī, “Būlī ng'wene ūyo akūlīhayaga lina lya ng'wa Seeba ni alekanage nū būbi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū mu kaya ja banhū shitabizaga mo shiseme shiteemagīzu dūhū, gītī sha zahabu na sha feza, nī sha mantī shikabizaga mo, pyī nī sha malongo; shingī shikabizaga sha milīmo y'ikūjo, shingī sha milīmo ya gīko gīko dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ūlū munhū wiyeeja, wīnga ū mu mihayo īyo ītī y'ikūjo, akūbiza shiseme sh'ikūjo, īsho shibeejiwe na kwejiwa kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Seeba, gīkī shiigeleelwe kūtūmama būlī nīmo gwawiza, ūyo shibeejiwe kūlwago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū bebe gūpeelage ū kwikūmva kwa shaalūki, ūdimane na būtūngīlīja, kūzunya, būtogwa na mhola; ūbize na būsangī na banhū abo bakūlīhayaga lina lya ng'wa Seeba mung'holò neela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īlemage ī mihayo ya nyachilū chilū īyo īfumile mu būtūmana, nguno managa gīkī ī mihayo yenīyo īkabyalaga wilemeelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntūmami wa ng'wa Seeba atigeleelilwe kūbiza nyombo, alīyo shiigelile abize nembeezu kū banhū bose, abize adūgije kūlanga na ng'wiyūmīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abize amanile kūbatonga mu widohya abo batogilwe halalī, nguno hamo ū Mulungu adūgije kūbinha moyo gwa kūgalūka na koya ū būbi, bayitegeleje ī ng'hana yose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bingīle mu masala madeekanu. Bīnge ū mu ntego go ng'wanishi ūmo walī wabagwasha ūbataligīnja na kūbatūūla mu būsese bo kwīta īyo atogilwe wei ng'wenekīlī!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
